{"t": 1792853710545, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "codex2", "Codex page 'The space in the pot' shows 'Translation: Working translation for Atman from the Sanskrit, awaiting review' and every page ends 'Sources: [..] (see RESEARCH.md)': development notes a player cannot follow (there is no RESEARCH.md in the game). The 'awaiting review' line undercuts trust in the verse. The left page list also truncates 'The space in the pot' to 'The space in the pot' cut at the panel edge."]}
{"t": 1792853710715, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "codex3", "Good: 'Other schools' page presents Advaita, Vishishtadvaita and Dvaita readings of tat tvam asi side by side and says plainly 'Atman teaches Advaita. It is one school's reading, not what Hinduism says.' The Advaita line references 'as the snake is put on the rope' before the player has met the rope at dusk (mild forward reference)."]}
